WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.478
The empirical curvature-memorization link now rests
on firm theory.

00:00:04.558 --> 00:00:11.622
Curvature provably upper-bounds memorization and is
itself bounded by the differential privacy parameter,

00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:13.051
closing the triangle.

00:00:13.131 --> 00:00:18.153
Needing no Hessian-convexity assumptions, it
applies to real deep networks,

00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:23.460
so cheap curvature is a justified proxy, and
privacy provably suppresses both.
